11
00:59:48,750 --> 00:59:54,750
Directed by Fred Wolf (in his feature length directorial debut), who also co-wrote the film with Peter Gaulke, the film stars Steve Zahn, Allen Covert, Jonah
Hill, Kevin Heffernan, Ashley Scott, Peter Dante, Harry Hamlin, Robert Patrick, Joe Don Baker, Justin Long, Jeff Garlin, and Ernest Borgnine.

12
01:05:15,000 --> 01:05:21,000
Production took place in 2005 but the film did not receive a
theatrical release until February 1, 2008.

13
01:10:41,250 --> 01:10:47,250
Strange Wilderness centers around the crew members of the titular fictional nature show heading to
Ecuador to investigate a Bigfoot sighting in order to keep the show from being cancelled.

14
01:16:07,500 --> 01:16:13,500
